<p class="section-number">04</p>
<div>
<h2 id="definitions-heading">A worked example: how cost becomes payment</h2>
<p>Using FY2025, follow the district formula from calculated cost to the grant paid and then to a SWEPT-inclusive total.</p>
</div>
</div>
