<section class="programs-band" id="programs" aria-labelledby="programs-heading">
<div class="shell section">
<div class="section-heading">
<p class="section-number">06</p>
<div>
<h2 id="programs-heading">Where the money and students went</h2>
<p>Total education funding includes district schools, charter schools, and EFAs. Growth in the last two categories is part of the statewide increase.</p>
